  "limitations": [
    "The optimization has three ABSTRACT commercial bidding-zone buses and two independent capacity-constrained market links, NOT a real Finnish transmission graph, AC/DC line electrical load flow or verified site connection capacity.",
    "Fingrid 38 and 39 report remaining commercial SE1/SE3→FI intraday trading capacity AFTER day-ahead. This is not actual physical NTC, a thermal line rating or a project's rights to import.",
    "SE1 and SE3 generation is assumed available. Real generating unit availability, market contracts, bids, import deliverability, electrical losses and dynamic stability are not represented.",
    "The model enforces actual original time-varying market-space caps separately for each corridor and tests losing either corridor. Optimized per-corridor allocation is not the measured physical or commercial transfer.",
    "All project penalty relaxation is mathematical, never measured outages. No site, 2030 or national full-year feasibility conclusion.",
    "Fingrid's internal P1 measured flows (dataset 30) and ended historical capacity datasets 28/29 require independent 2025 source audits before any physical north-south cut model. Their limits must not be guessed."
  ]
